{"2140700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SO BELOW", "steam_appid": 2140700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4292710], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/5f96325ecaeba1d4e5c0006c20ac7bb7.poster.avif?t=1778517579\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/5f96325ecaeba1d4e5c0006c20ac7bb7.webm?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/5f96325ecaeba1d4e5c0006c20ac7bb7.mp4?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gear up, learn, adapt, exorcise.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of SO BELOW. Meet HEXA GmbH, your new employer. Your job is to cleanse haunted properties from their unwanted hosts. We provide the tools, you provide the exorcising, and we all get the money. Please remember: DON’T DIE! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/371f0893c59275bbb78ceece21156b82.poster.avif?t=1778517579\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/371f0893c59275bbb78ceece21156b82.webm?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/371f0893c59275bbb78ceece21156b82.mp4?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Next-level exorcizing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SO BELOW, you are to become a professional top-tier exorcist. Learn how to exorcise each entity. Some are easy, just use your trusty crucifix. Some are difficult, we’re talking rituals, puzzles, boss fights, and well, a lot of dying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/fe131b905f2d6e2f79b27b471f3e12a4.poster.avif?t=1778517579\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/fe131b905f2d6e2f79b27b471f3e12a4.webm?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/fe131b905f2d6e2f79b27b471f3e12a4.mp4?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is easy with the right pals, and exorcisms are no different. Get together and explore the haunted buildings, learn what to do and how to do it, and get rid of all the evil entities. For the company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/23b391a259846f32bb86c477c0865e56.poster.avif?t=1778517579\" width=1124 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/23b391a259846f32bb86c477c0865e56.webm?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/23b391a259846f32bb86c477c0865e56.mp4?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique tools, unique rituals, unique entities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Being the best means knowing your toolkit. Being the best means getting to know your rituals. Each device, crucifix, relic, puzzle and piece of information is crucial to your job. Be the best exorcist, or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/574f6913468bd274b50d366d6b847b11.poster.avif?t=1778517579\" width=1080 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/574f6913468bd274b50d366d6b847b11.webm?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/574f6913468bd274b50d366d6b847b11.mp4?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ever-changing haunted locations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted maps with a touch of randomness. Rooms might change locations, entities may spawn and control different areas. No two hunts are the same. You’ll have to rely on your team, and above all, your knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/ce84b10c0fdd98166936aaf93aa2aba1.poster.avif?t=1778517579\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/ce84b10c0fdd98166936aaf93aa2aba1.webm?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140700/extras/ce84b10c0fdd98166936aaf93aa2aba1.mp4?t=1778517579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>VERITAS OMNIA VINCIT</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-alig